{"name": "Chumini: Tiny Army", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Small creatures, but massive destruction!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/5ba542edb9f872f75b5f929c2fb4bd57.poster.avif?t=1787668349\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/5ba542edb9f872f75b5f929c2fb4bd57.webm?t=1787668349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/5ba542edb9f872f75b5f929c2fb4bd57.mp4?t=1787668349\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this colorful <i>survivors-like</i>, summon your trusted allies, the <strong>Chuminis</strong>, to battle hords of forest demons! It\u2019s up to you to manage each Chumini\u2019s <strong>unique behavior</strong> to survive for 20 minutes, and defeat the Dark Druidess. There\u2019re 15 different Chuminis to choose from: find the <strong>best synergies</strong> that suit your playstyle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/79fb16d6e9e2d5c1fddabfce7f7efcad.poster.avif?t=1787668349\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/79fb16d6e9e2d5c1fddabfce7f7efcad.webm?t=1787668349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/79fb16d6e9e2d5c1fddabfce7f7efcad.mp4?t=1787668349\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect experience from the defeated demons, build your army of powerful allies and upgrade them to survive! Some Chuminis will run in a circle around you, others will follow your every step\u2026 <strong>Optimize your movement to take advantage of your allies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/f371dd1a9b6554ac774658f727feee01.poster.avif?t=1787668349\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/f371dd1a9b6554ac774658f727feee01.webm?t=1787668349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/extras/f371dd1a9b6554ac774658f727feee01.mp4?t=1787668349\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 different Chuminis to summon, upgrade, and use in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An \"ability\" system tied to each Chumini</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 unique enemies and 2 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colorful hand-drawn graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A meta-progression system offering replayability and difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements to collect!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What you WONT find in our Survivors-like (for now):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different maps or levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not expect endless replayabity through unlock</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "In this cute and colorful survivors-like, summon an army of tiny Chuminis to battle waves of forest demons. Each Chumini has its own movement patterns: it's up to you to manage this merry mess to create an unstoppable force!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310000/header.jpg?t=1787668349", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Heaven", "Bullet Hell", "Action Roguelike", "Cute", "2D", "Roguelike"], "developers": "Guilloteam", "publishers": "Guilloteam", "release_date": "Jan 30, 2026", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "3310000", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "12 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/qkNu8yj9qW8", "first_seen": 1739318400.0, "review_rank": 1933}